On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Secret Agent]Clarence is in [Bellua Village]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Secret Agent]Clarence is in [Asga Village]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Hi <selfname>? Have you come to help prepare the Festival?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Welcome. We need your help. Food needs to be delivered to the castle but there is still a lot missing. [Aged Wine Fruit] is needed, could you get it for me?\n\nYou have to help [Secret Deputy] Clarence to obtain Wine Fruit."

On in_progress
    Say "Not done yet? We have to hurry to finish the Festival preparations."

On claimable
    Show quest "One, two ... That's everything! Thanks for you help. I should compensate you! These are the weapons I used to use, take what you need!"
